{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はお仕事のあと伊織と\nあそびにいったよー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろ最近あって\n落ち込んでたりむしゃくしゃしてたり\nスッキリしない毎日だったけど\n伊織と遊んでスッキリ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初は上野行ったんだけど\nそのまま浅草まで歩いて\n浅草で大学いも半分こして\nあげまんじゅうを1つずつ食べて\nメロンパンも1つずつ食べた！\nメンチカツは半分こ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織と日奈子は何でも半分こ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4つ中2つしか半分こしてないけど(｡・・｡)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのあとはスカイツリーまで歩いて\nぷらぷらしたよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お洋服も買ったの♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織とバイバイしてからは\n1人でDVD借りに行ったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにを借りたかは秘密～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/14/1521096/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/14/1521096/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子はカスタード！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織はあんこ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/14/1521096/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は朝寒くて起きちゃう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒いね～秋通り越して冬だね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、明後日から数日\n少し暖かくなるんだよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"土日は大事なお仕事なので\nがんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/14/1521096/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ね、誰かの曲を誰かがカバーした曲を聴くのにはまってる！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オリジナルもいいけど\nカバーもいいよね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"48グループ46グループのそれぞれの\nライブで曲をカバーし合うのも\nおもしろそう！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"48グループさんのだとね～\n選びきれないな～好きな曲多い！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし！真剣に何の曲にしようか\n考え見よう！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスが難しい\n僕たちは戦わないは\nアンダーメンバーでやりたいな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/14/1521096/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/14/1521096/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐはははははは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食ってやる～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/14/1521096/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"